FULL_STACK_DEVELOPER_2026_COMPLETE - Phase 05                                                                Build the In-Memory Todo API

Build a temporary in-memory Todo API
We now need a concrete protocol surface to exercise. The data deliberately lives in memory so a server restart resets it. That
limitation is not a bug in this phase - it isolates HTTP behavior from database persistence. Volume 03 will solve persistence
properly.

